<title>CANADA: GM Canada sales rise 5.9 pct in January.</title>
<headline>GM Canada sales rise 5.9 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Monday its sales for January were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	    +5.9		   27,479	   25,947</p>
<p>   Cars	     +5.7		   15,339	   14,507</p>
<p>   Trucks	   +6.1		   12,140	   11,440</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	    +5.9		   27,479	   25,947</p>
<p>   Cars	     +5.7		   15,339	   14,507</p>
<p>   Trucks	   +6.1		   12,140	   11,440</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
